   "Atlas/Rudvalis/ReferenceLinearLifts.lean:3:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/-- A transvection fixing p transports any two forms taking value one at p. -/\nnoncomputable def activeFormTransvection (p a b : Point) (ha : dot a.val p.val = 1) (hb : dot b.val p.val = 1) :\n    E ≃ₗ[Bit] E where\n  toFun v := v + dot (a.val + b.val) v • p.val\n  invFun v := v + dot (a.val + b.val) v • p.val\n  left_inv\n    v := by\n    have hz : dot (a.val + b.val) p.val = 0 := by rw [dot_add_left, ha, hb]; decide\n    simp only [dot_add_right, dot_smul_right, hz, mul_zero, add_zero]\n    rw [add_assoc, ← add_smul]\n    have hh (k : Bit) : k + k = 0 := by exact Atlas.Codes.bit_self_add k\n    rw [hh, zero_smul, add_zero]\n  right_inv\n    v := by\n    have hz : dot (a.val + b.val) p.val = 0 := by rw [dot_add_left, ha, hb]; decide\n    simp only [dot_add_right, dot_smul_right, hz, mul_zero, add_zero]\n    rw [add_assoc, ← add_smul]\n    have hh (k : Bit) : k + k = 0 := by exact Atlas.Codes.bit_self_add k\n    rw [hh, zero_smul, add_zero]\n  map_add' v w := by rw [dot_add_right, add_smul]; abel\n  map_smul' k v := by simp only [dot_smul_right, smul_add, smul_smul, RingHom.id_apply]`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
